<title>FRANCE: Block trade in Rhone-Poulenc.</title>
<headline>Block trade in Rhone-Poulenc.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chemical group Rhone-Poulenc SA was the subject of a block trade of 610,000 shares at 160 francs per share at 1452 GMT, share traders said.</p>
<p>Rhone-Poulenc was up 1.52 percent at 160 francs at 1534 GMT, it earlier hit a fresh year high of 162 francs.</p>
</text>
